@startuml dp8-adapter
!include _style.puml
title DP#8 Adapter — 외부 Skypass API 인터페이스 변환

interface SkypassInterface <<Target>> {
  +verifyMembership(num, pw): Object
  +getMileageBalance(num): int
  +deductMileage(num, amount): boolean
  +verifyAndDeduct(num, amount): Object
}
class SkypassAdapter <<Adapter>> {
  -remoteApi: RemoteSkypassApi
}
class RemoteSkypassApi <<Adaptee>> {
  +postAuth(code, token): Map
  +getMileage(code): Map
  +postDeduct(code, amount): Map
}
class PaymentController <<Client>>

SkypassInterface <|.. SkypassAdapter
SkypassAdapter o--> RemoteSkypassApi : 위임/변환
PaymentController ..> SkypassInterface : 마일리지 잔액/결제
note bottom of SkypassAdapter : 외부 API 시그니처를\n우리 인터페이스로 감싼다
@enduml
